## 📋 Overview

Cloud security fundamentals covering AWS, Azure, and GCP. This guide covers shared responsibility, IAM, network security, and best practices.

---

## 🔄 Shared Responsibility Model

| Responsibility | AWS | Azure | GCP |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Physical Security** | Cloud Provider | Cloud Provider | Cloud Provider |
| **Network Infrastructure** | Cloud Provider | Cloud Provider | Cloud Provider |
| **Operating System** | Customer | Customer | Customer |
| **Applications** | Customer | Customer | Customer |
| **Data** | Customer | Customer | Customer |
| **Access Management** | Customer | Customer | Customer |

