## 🛡️ IAM (Identity & Access Management)

### Best Practices
- [ ] Use MFA for all users
- [ ] Implement least privilege
- [ ] Rotate credentials regularly
- [ ] Monitor IAM activity
- [ ] Use IAM roles for services

